guardrail-rag-jev

Derived from guardrail-chatbot-jev (https://github.com/taman-spirit/guardrail-chatbot-jev) by the
same author: the decision engine, the hazard taxonomy and the Viet Nam compliance texts were adapted
from it for retrieval-augmented generation.

Third-party references
----------------------

The hazard taxonomy cites MLCommons AILuminate, Meta Llama Guard and the OWASP Top 10 for LLM
Applications 2025. The Viet Nam packs cite the Law on Cybersecurity 2025 (Law No. 116/2025/QH15),
the Law on Artificial Intelligence (Law No. 134/2025/QH15), the Law on Personal Data Protection
(Law No. 91/2025/QH15) and Decree 356/2025/ND-CP. They are cited as sources; this software is not
legal advice.

TypeSafe Jev and the OpenAI Decisions API are third-party services with their own terms.

